        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Willo%2C_Arizona"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In the 1980s, residents lobbied for special conservation district status, securing historic preservation for future generations.",
