        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://willophx.com/about/history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Holcomb settled Willo’s southern portion in 1878, later dividing the area into northern and southern sections.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
